  "description": "Spearings are delighted to present this recently renovated apartment in Dublin 8. A new standard of city living with this selection of quality apartments, ideally situated on the highly sought-after Eugene Street in Dublin 8. Recently renovated to an exceptional standard, each apartment offers a perfect blend of contemporary style, comfort, and character, making them an ideal choice for anyone seeking a prime city-centre home. Key Features: High-Standard Renovation: Step inside to find a beautifully finished interior, where every detail has been thoughtfully considered. The apartments feature modern, sleek kitchens with state-of-the-art appliances and stunning, high-quality bathrooms, creating an inviting and elegant living space. Contemporary Living: The layouts are designed to maximize space and light, with open-plan living areas that are perfect for both relaxing and entertaining. Neutral colour palettes and tasteful finishes provide a clean, modern aesthetic that is ready for you to make your own. Ideal Location: Nestled on a quiet, mature residential street, these apartments offer a peaceful retreat from the urban buzz while being just a short walk from the heart of Dublin city center. You'll enjoy unparalleled access to a wealth of amenities, including a vibrant selection of independent cafes, shops, and markets. Excellent Connectivity: Commuting is effortless with an abundance of public transport options on your doorstep. The area is well-serviced by numerous Dublin Bus routes, and the LUAS Red Line is just a short stroll away, providing quick and easy access to all parts of the city. Cultural Hub: Immerse yourself in the rich history and cultural energy of Dublin 8. The area is home to iconic landmarks such as St. Patrick's Cathedral and the Guinness Storehouse, and is within easy walking distance of Trinity College and the RCSI. These apartments represent a rare opportunity to acquire a beautifully modernised home in one of Dublin's most dynamic and desirable neighbourhoods. Early viewing is highly recommended to avoid disappointment.",
